•	User accesses the system while online (caches data)
•	Takes the device offline (airplane mode, no signal)
•	Enter actual data for assigned KPIs
•	System stores entries locally
•	When back online, syncs automatically
What's Supported Offline:
•	View assigned KPIs and targets
•	Enter actual data
•	Add notes and evidence (photos from camera)
•	Submit for validation (queued until online)
Conflict Resolution:
•	If multiple offline entries conflict, last sync wins
•	Supervisor approvals require online connection
•	Evidence uploads sync in background
Data Limits:
•	Configurable offline data retention (default 30 days)
•	Local storage limits apply (browser-dependent)
•	Large files (photos) compress before sync
This is particularly useful for field workers, remote teams, or users in areas with unreliable internet connectivity.
